* Place a {@i:Mahogany Bed|4} {i:Mahogany Bed|Mahogany Bed|4} in your Mog House then speak to the Moogle.
** If you have an item that gives weekly conquest rewards, such as {i:Aurum Coffer|Aurum Coffer|3735}, you may need to remove this item from your layout in order to trigger the quest
